[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――では、最後に。生徒会長の当選者を発表します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, for our final announcement. I will reveal the winner of the student council president election."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ohhh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次期生徒会長に当選したのは――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The next student council president is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術科２年、ユナ・ヴァイツさんです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna Waitz, second-year alchemy student!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――――！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "——!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "や……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったぁーーーーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "WE DID IIIIT!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナ先輩！\u3000やりましたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Juna! You did it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいぞー！\u3000ユナー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Way to go, Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ？\u3000あんた、出口調査では\nロマンに入れてなかった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold up. Didn't you say you were voting for Roman in our exit poll?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……なんつーか、夢を持ってない奴だって\n思われる気がして、つい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... I was worried about being seen as someone without dreams, so I just..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、最後はユナに投票したよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But in the end, I voted for Juna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーん、なるほどねえ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, interesting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "表には出さなくとも、ユナに共感する生徒が\n多かったということでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems many students related to Juna's message, even if they didn't express it openly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "物言わぬ多数派……\nサイレントマジョリティですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The silent majority! That's what we're seeing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナちゃん！\u3000やったね！\u3000やったね……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna! You did it! You really did it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……ありがとう。\nロロナや皆の助けがあったおかげだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... thank you. It's all thanks to you and everyone else's help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、当選したユナさんには、\n勝利演説をしていただきます。壇上へどうぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, we invite the elected president Juna to deliver her victory speech. Please take the stage!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この度、次期生徒会長に当選したユナ・ヴァイツだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Juna Waitz, your newly elected student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは、推薦人のロロナをはじめ、\nこの選挙に向けて協力してくれた皆に感謝を申し上げる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, I want to express my gratitude to Rorona, who nominated me, and to everyone who supported me throughout this election."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……この中には、私を支持していない者たちも\n大勢いることだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sure there are many among you who did not vote for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確固たる夢を持って学園生活を送っており、\n私の考えが理解できない……そういう者もいるはずだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those who have clear dreams guiding their academy life, who cannot understand my perspective... I know you're out there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、それは……ある意味では、\n私が目指すべき理想の姿でもある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But in a way... that represents the ideal I strive toward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうか、夢なき者たちを見守っていてほしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Please, watch over those of us who have yet to find our dreams."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして、私を信じて票を託してくれたみんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And to everyone who believed in me and gave me their vote—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私とともに、それぞれの夢を探しに行こう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's set out together to find our dreams!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]